Setup global macros:
	¤		THIS_LIBRARY

Processing setup:
	import re


Section: The Mnemonic Text Tree Processing System

	Section: Language

		Section: Tokens

			Primary source:
				/library/mnemonic_language/tokens.py

			Setup context:
				T = ¤.symbol.text.token

			Hierarchical mapping: base
				Sub heading: Common
				Setup:
					Key datatype: ¤.symbol_factory.Symbol
					Value processor: re.compile

				Map: T.word: r'\w+'
				Map: T.whitespace: r'\s+'
				Map: T.literal: None

				Hierarchical mapping: mnemonic_expression
					Sub heading: Mnemonic Expression
					Map: T.right_curly_bracket: r'\}'

					Functional description:
						A mnemonic expression is used for specifying captures or complex matching rules

				Hierarchical mapping: opt_epxression
					Sub heading: Optional Expression
					Map: T.right_square_bracket: r'\]'
					Map: T.left_square_bracket: r'\['

					Functional description:
						Optional expressions create branch points in the matching pattern

				Hierarchical mapping: mnemonic
					Sub heading: Mnemonic Pattern
					Map: T.left_curly_bracket: r'\{'
					Map: T.left_square_bracket: r'\['

					Functional description:
						Mnemonic patterns are used extensively through this project in order to make it easy for humans to interact with the system.
